imi dau seama ca repo uri se poate extrage direct din json. E acolo un camp nedocumentat `_links` care-l contine printre altele.
Imediat fac un pr.

@criske Yes, the talk will happen in the ``available()`` method, but there will be no ``getWalletById(...)``. Simply:

```java
public Wallet wallet() {
    final Wallet wallet;
    if(this.walletId == null) {
        wallet = new Wallet.Missing();
    } else {
        wallet = new SvcWallet(this.walletId); //some Wallet implementation which talks to the microservice.
    }
    return wallet;
}
```

So until we have SvcWallet there is not much to do :D

@criske Wanna take this one? It's not complicated, just see how the Hello conversation is implemented.
The only difference is, the Confused conversation will be the last one in the chain, so it won't encapsulate any ``next`` Conversation. 

The ``Confused`` conversation should simply build and return a SendReply step, with a reply message saying something like ``"@author Sorry, I did not understand that"``

